{"unit_id": "tag:01R1:prose-0002", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n在<REF_0001>中，此层（sheaf）记作<MATH_0001>。我们不采用这一约定，因为我们打算把记号<MATH_0002>留给<TEXTITOPEN_0001>该浸入（immersion）的法（normal）层（sheaf）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>。在余法（conormal）层（sheaf）是有限表示（finite presentation）的条件下，它定义为\n<MATH_0003>\n（否则，法（normal）层（sheaf）甚至可能不是拟凝聚（quasi-coherent）的）。我们将在后文再讨论法（normal）层（sheaf）（在此插入将来的引用）。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "immersion", "target_term": "浸入"}, {"source_term": "normal", "target_term": "法"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "conormal", "target_term": "余法"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "finite presentation", "target_term": "有限表示"}, {"source_term": "normal", "target_term": "法"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚"}, {"source_term": "normal", "target_term": "法"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层", "context": "所引文献中使用该记号的层"}, {"source_term": "immersion", "target_term": "浸入", "context": "要为其法层保留记号的浸入"}, {"source_term": "normal", "target_term": "法", "context": "保留该记号的层的类型"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层", "context": "保留该记号的法层"}, {"source_term": "conormal", "target_term": "余法", "context": "对其要求有限表示的层的类型"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层", "context": "定义条件所涉及的余法层"}, {"source_term": "finite presentation", "target_term": "有限表示", "context": "该定义成立的条件"}, {"source_term": "normal", "target_term": "法", "context": "括注中所述层的类型"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层", "context": "括注中可能不拟凝聚的法层"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚", "context": "未必具备的性质"}, {"source_term": "normal", "target_term": "法", "context": "后文将再讨论的层的类型"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层", "context": "后文将再讨论的法层"}], "notes": []}
