{"unit_id": "tag:01UQ:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为概形（schemes）之间的态射（morphism）。<TEXTITOPEN_0001>微分层（sheaf of differentials）<MATH_0002>（<MATH_0003>在<MATH_0004>上的）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>是把<MATH_0005>视为赋环空间态射（morphism of ringed spaces）时的微分层（sheaf of differentials）（《模（Modules）》中的定义<REF_0001>），配备其<TEXTITOPEN_0002>泛（universal）<MATH_0006>-导子（derivation）<TEXTITCLOSE_0002>\n<MATH_0007>\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "sheaf of differentials", "target_term": "微分层"}, {"source_term": "morphism of ringed spaces", "target_term": "赋环空间态射"}, {"source_term": "sheaf of differentials", "target_term": "微分层"}, {"source_term": "Modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "universal", "target_term": "泛"}, {"source_term": "derivation", "target_term": "导子"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "定义中态射的源和靶"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "要定义其微分层的态射"}, {"source_term": "sheaf of differentials", "target_term": "微分层", "context": "本定义所给出的层"}, {"source_term": "morphism of ringed spaces", "target_term": "赋环空间态射", "context": "用于套用已有定义的态射类型"}, {"source_term": "sheaf of differentials", "target_term": "微分层", "context": "已有定义中赋环空间态射的微分层"}, {"source_term": "Modules", "target_term": "模", "context": "已有定义所在章节"}, {"source_term": "universal", "target_term": "泛", "context": "微分层所配备的导子的性质"}, {"source_term": "derivation", "target_term": "导子", "context": "微分层所配备的导子"}], "notes": []}
